# Nothing is excluded. This repository is handed to operators over GitHub as a
# complete folder: the seaView installer, the launch script, the config and the
# guides all travel with it, so a clone needs no other downloads.
#
# seaview.conf is committed with working defaults and is meant to be edited in
# place on each machine. If you later pull updates, git may report a conflict
# on it -- keep your local version.
